  💭 a second look, and the empty text when it is not: it begins with a slash and does
  💭 not end with one, and between its slashes there are letters, digits, hyphens, dots,
  💭 underscores and tildes, at least one, and not a dot or two by themselves. So it has
  💭 no second slash at its start, which a browser reads as another site, no way up, and
  💭 nothing that ends a header's line.
